        "title": "What to Expect While Breastfeeding | Infant and Toddler Nutrition | CDC",
        "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/infant-toddler-nutrition/breastfeeding/what-to-expect-while-breastfeeding.html",
        "description": "This page describes what to expect while breastfeeding in the first days and as your baby grows.",
